{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Phase 1 RCA (rebar-debug fast path)\n\nConfirmed root cause: `test_full_backend_account_is_present` leaves `_METRIC_CANDIDATES` host-dependent while asserting that the metric backend is always represented (`tests/unit/grounding/test_coverage_reconstruction.py:100-109`). On this host `_resolve_binary((\"scc\", \"lizard\"))` resolves `/opt/homebrew/bin/scc`; the 50-LOC fixture is below the 800-LOC threshold, so `_metric_invoke` returns no match and therefore emits no metric coverage record (`src/rebar/grounding/engine_b_backends.py:336-420`). The test then reconstructs only opengrep and ast-grep and fails.\n\nRuntime proof: the focused test deterministically failed at line 109. Post-mortem inspection showed `_METRIC_CANDIDATES == (\"scc\", \"lizard\")`, resolved binary `/opt/homebrew/bin/scc`, and no metric record. In the same runtime, replacing the candidates with `(\"missing-metric-tool\",)` made the scan emit `metric: skipped=1, reason=no_tool`, ruling out production coverage reconstruction and fixture language detection as alternatives.\n\nDefect legitimacy: defect. The file-level contract requires ran/skipped reconstruction without silent no-ops, and the trusted sibling test at lines 83-95 explicitly forces optional-tool absence to avoid host coupling. Commit ca9651da285 introduced the host-independent coverage-reconstruction contract; commit d065590637 added that fixture control to the sibling but omitted this full-account test.\n\nExpected post-fix behavior: this test controls optional metric-tool availability and deterministically observes the contractual skipped/no_tool record on every supported host. Caller-dependency gate: test-only fixture control; no production caller or behavioral dependency changes. Phase 2 is unlocked."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786058905213317001,"uuid":"e7d683bc-4f2d-4abf-80da-315d78124fe8"}